    - target: {fileID: 6303369563507938974, guid: 888ff82ccbb828942b5fe6cc9718388d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_body
      value: "Colin gasps as he starts to feel something growing against his lascivious
        dumpy. The hands of an unknown person are sliding against his hips. Excitement
        starts to swell inside him.\r\nSo long has he been waiting for something
        like this. The mysterious person's hot breath tickles his ears, sending a
        shiver down his spine: it's Hugo.\r\n\r\n\"Pardon j'esp\xE8re que ma Hot
        Wheels\xAE 1969 Pink Rear-Loading Beach Bomb qui est dans ma poche ne t'as
        pas fait mal\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6303369563507938974, guid: 888ff82ccbb828942b5fe6cc9718388d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_header
      value: FAN NON-FICTION
